WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Ryu falls after the target ender.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.150
Kimberly advances with the two-dash approach.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.500
The retreat makes Ryu’s throw attempt miss.

4
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.900
Standing heavy punch punishes the missed throw.

5
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.000
Sprint stop and standing heavy kick lead into the medium target.

6
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.200
Sprint slide completes the punish.

7
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:06.650
Both fighters have returned to standing after the completed knockdown route.
